      "rationale": "Mũhianĩre wa aingĩ wa Kĩam 1:26 — 'nĩtũ' kuuma Erohimu ũmwe; ndũkonongorio ũrĩa ũgũthoma agĩĩkũmenya atĩa."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "הרמש \/ הרמש",
      "rationale": "Kĩrĩa gĩcĩmagĩrĩra kĩcĩmagĩrĩra — kĩugo kĩmwe kĩmeretwo gitarya rĩa kĩndũ na gĩtũngĩ kĩa kĩndũ kĩu kĩenyuo ndũkĩmenyeka na mũgambo mweha."
    },
    {
